62_config.v1 (config.v2, #985 G4): sx1262-medium's three group types, then the five types zk2 config derive writes from them. The bounds are illustrative; zenoh-modem chooses the real ones.","types":{"Control":{"description":"confirm, cancel, extend and persist's request, derived (v2.md 2.10, 3)","fields":[{"maximum":281474976710655,"minimum":0,"name":"token","type":"int"},{"maximum":65535,"minimum":1,"name":"confirm_s","optional":true,"type":"int"}]},"Duty":{"description":"The duty budget: what fraction of a trailing period may be spent on air","fields":[{"description":"The allowed fraction of the period, in parts per million (EU868: 10000)","maximum":1000000,"minimum":0,"name":"fraction_ppm","type":"int"},{"description":"The trailing period the fraction is measured over (EU868: 3600)","maximum":86400,"minimum":1,"name":"period_s","type":"int"}]},"Error":{"description":"Every operation's error detail, derived (v2.md 2.5, 3)","fields":[{"escape":true,"name":"code","type":"enum","values":["device_refused"],"width":4}]},"Modulation":{"description":"What Zenoh's batch size was chosen against: changed in the startup file","fields":[{"description":"The spreading factor","maximum":9,"minimum":7,"name":"spreading_factor","type":"int"}]},"Radio":{"description":"The channel: both ends must move together, or the link is gone","fields":[{"description":"The carrier frequency","maximum":960000000,"minimum":150000000,"name":"frequency_hz","type":"int"}]},"Record":{"description":"config.v2's record, derived (v2.md 2.3, 3): state/config and every reply","fields":[{"maximum":4294967295,"minimum":0,"name":"instance","type":"int"},{"maximum":4294967295,"minimum":0,"name":"revision","type":"int"},{"maximum":65535,"minimum":1,"name":"floor_s","type":"int"},{"name":"would_be","type":"bool"},{"maximum":281474976710655,"minimum":0,"name":"pending_token","optional":true,"type":"int"},{"name":"pending_apply_at","optional":true,"type":"time"},{"name":"pending_deadline","optional":true,"type":